"Settings could not be read, so MTPLX is using defaults. %@ could not be set aside and will be replaced on the next save." = "无法读取设置，MTPLX 正在使用默认设置。无法将 %@ 移至备份位置；下次保存时会将其替换。";
"Your earlier chats could not be opened. They were kept as %@ and a new chat history was started." = "无法打开你之前的聊天。它们已保留为 %@，并已创建新的聊天记录。";
"Chats cannot be saved right now, so this session's chats will not be kept." = "目前无法保存聊天，因此本次会话的聊天不会被保留。";
"Unsaved changes" = "未保存的更改";
"Your edits are kept while you use other tabs. Save them to apply, or revert to the saved values." = "你切换到其他标签页时，编辑内容会保留。保存以应用更改，或还原为已保存的值。";
"Stall watchdog" = "停滞看门狗";
"Seconds a response may wait on a model that is making no progress before it is cancelled. 0 turns the watchdog off; long prompts and deep reasoning keep reporting progress and are never cut short by this." = "响应在等待无进展的模型多少秒后被取消。0 表示关闭看门狗；长提示和深度推理会持续报告进展，绝不会因此被中断。";
